# Derived from your own disc — never committed. These are the artifacts that must
# stay out of a published clone: extraction output, disc images, and the saved
# executable bytes a patch replaced.

# The `snowknife import` / `gltf` intermediate (raw OBJ/JSON/PNG/WAV + gltf/), plus
# Overrides/ — the hand-authored prop remodel packages `snowknife overrides` installs.
Maps/*

# Executable bytes a snowknife patch replaced, saved beside the ISO they came from
# so --revert can restore it. Specific to one image, and never redistributable.
*.snowknife-restore.json

*.iso

# Build output
bin/
obj/

# IDE
.vs/
*.user

# Python scratch
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
